<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-080-B habitat research</name><desc>WGS84 coordinates. Habitat research; tracks show outlines and structure alignments, not navigation routes. Check current rules and charted hazards.</desc></metadata><wpt lat="35.415906" lon="-120.888359"><name>SC26-080-B</name><cmt>SC26-080</cmt><desc>Morro Bay rough reef Mapped rough-rock high; 4.4 m relief across 210 m. Terrain B 56/100; not catch probability. Center 43 ft; nearby 40–56 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. No additional flag from this depth and closure screening. Subtle local relief in the rendered grid; primarily a mapped-bottom investigation option. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9HEZNRO"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-061</name><desc>Partial nearby mapped rough-rock/bedrock footprint, clipped within 350 m of retained targets and by depth/closure screening; not the complete reef or an individual pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.41783269753797" lon="-120.88770344536313"/><trkpt lat="35.417562377338555" lon="-120.88771050393476"/><trkpt lat="35.41747612245156" lon="-120.88793300549804"/><trkpt lat="35.41732478484702" lon="-120.88958882376141"/><trkpt lat="35.41705831267343" lon="-120.88981602376136"/><trkpt lat="35.41706985540045" lon="-120.8904764675856"/><trkpt lat="35.41679953468317" lon="-120.89048351669646"/><trkpt lat="35.4168091507705" lon="-120.89103388500102"/><trkpt lat="35.415817974342865" lon="-120.89105972420694"/><trkpt lat="35.41562814475411" lon="-120.89051406175902"/><trkpt lat="35.415265793623284" lon="-120.89041338833607"/><trkpt lat="35.415258098981354" lon="-120.88997310224367"/><trkpt lat="35.41579681641353" lon="-120.88984892908